In <1f.8718.1682.0NC5FA16@compart.fi> riku.saikkonen@compart.fi (Riku Saikkonen) writes:

>What's the most dangerous non-unique monster in Nethack?

IMHO- Archons. They do a lot of damage, stun you (the blinding is useful.
Keeps you from getting stunned again), curse stuff, and summon in other
monsters. My last ascension (with a Healer, the last of the 12 classes for me)
almost got wiped out when something read a cursed scroll of create monster,
summoning in 4 Archons and a horde of other monsters around me. I only survived
by reading a scroll of tame monster, moving through my pets away from the
Archons, and then using a ring of conflict and running away. I still died
once (Amulets of Lifesaving are useful). The Astral plane was nothing after
that.

After Archons I'd put Master Liches toward the top. They have the same powers
as Archons, but have fewer HP and do less damage. They also don't stun/blind.
I usually genocide L's ASAP.

Most of the other dangerous monsters (mind flayers, minotaurs, etc) are easily
dealt with.

>I.e. Do I have too good stuff in wizard mode since an Archon died from
>two blows? (from a +50 Demonbane :-))

Yes...
